{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"Shoga awakens abruptly with a start.  Staring around she re-orients herself to her surroundings.  Shaking her head to clear what remains of sleep she moves slowly when suddenly overtaken by visions.","created_at":"2020-07-20T11:31:49.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734734307385540658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
