{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"Looking up after hearing his name. \"Hi again Traxim. I suppose you found the friend you were going to show it to?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:51:26.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735222426840989826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"“Yes, I have shown it to the Archivist.” He sits across from Kyrre and begins unfastening the straps on his pack. “He believes this book belonged to Tenser.” He takes it out and passes it across the table.","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:53:33.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735222962260672582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"\"*The* Tenser?\" Kyrre is quite awestruck, and gingerly picks up the book - tracing its back as he does so.","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:55:03.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735223335931347014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"\"That is quite remarkable, imagine what fascinating mysteries he managed to solve!\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:55:29.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735223446925213838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"“I believe so. I was surprised to hear it as well.”","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:55:42.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735223500930809997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"\"Did the Archivist know anything of the library itself? How it ended up locked in a sewer?\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:57:18.564000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735223904213270569","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"Traxim frowns before answering. “Nothing that he mentioned but he has a lot going on between preparing for the expedition and hosting an event later today.”","created_at":"2020-07-21T19:58:59.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735224328248885370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"\"I suppose so.\" Kyrre looks just the slightest bit dissappointed, but quickly recovers. \"Well I'm sure there are many more mysteries to answer in time\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T20:00:22.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735224674895527948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636015050829856768","content":"“You should come by the temple this evening. The archivist has invited someone who may be able to clear up some of the recent mysteries.” Then he stood up and left. “Enjoy that piece of history friend.”","created_at":"2020-07-21T20:05:23.518000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735225938257903748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
